          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1859",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · ​The Detox gently dissolves all that d…",
            "text": "​The Detox gently dissolves all that dried residue without stripping my barrier, and the serum provides pure, weightless hydration directly to the skin bed 🫧",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1860",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · ​The regrowth spurt has been unreal. T…",
            "text": "​The regrowth spurt has been unreal. The density at the follicle level is wild!! So many thick, strong new strands poking through all across my crown and down to the nape of my neck 🌱✨ My scalp can finally breathe again and feels completely calm and weightless 🪶 10/10 worth every single penny!",
